Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.17,0:00:39.57,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx150\fscy120\c&H000000&\move(342,350,318,348,1,4380)}Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:39.57,yamato,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\c&H0000FF&\fscx347\fscy257\pos(868,926)}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:39.57,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx167\fscy142\c&H000000&\move(1490,872,1510,886,3,3840)}Soldiers of Love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.50,0:01:44.92,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.92,0:01:48.47,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,You gave us hope for our revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.47,0:01:51.49,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Why do you protect the remnants of Desler ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.93,0:01:56.67,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter !\NDestroy any ship that opposes us !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.17,0:02:01.62,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,Another wave ! \NTwelve missiles from above !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.01,0:02:04.12,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Intercept !\N Don't miss a single one !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.33,0:02:05.85,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Bow torpedoes, fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.20,0:02:15.90,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Don't stop !\NSplit up into the three ships !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.27,0:02:21.38,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,All of those ships will head to Earth,\N so just get on any one of them !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.74,0:02:25.32,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Don't get hit by those stray missiles\N until all the refugees are brought aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.72,0:02:29.87,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,More ships detected in the gas clouds. \NThey appear to be reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.06,0:02:31.22,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Reinforcements ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.22,0:02:33.58,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,No, that ID is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.29,0:02:36.69,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Those are interplanetary ballistic missiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.27,0:02:40.17,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,How did they obtain such things ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.20,0:02:45.62,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Destruction, revolution, war...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.62,0:02:48.55,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,They occur in any civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.41,0:02:55.66,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,After these meaningless cycles, a critical \Nmistake brings about self destruction in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.53,0:02:59.26,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,That's laughable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.50,0:03:05.30,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,For nations, families, convictions...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.33,0:03:11.87,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{ai yue}...for love, humans steal and kill. \NThat's unbearable to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.90,0:03:19.98,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{warera}Humans will only obtain true happiness and\N eternal peace thanks to our genuine love.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.24,0:03:24.57,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{warera}We are Gatlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.17,0:03:27.16,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Our lives are deliberately{purposefully} manufactured.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.25,0:03:33.48,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Incoming message from the Garmillas ship, warning us that the rebel force might use interplanetary ballistic missiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.95,0:03:37.30,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,If they use those on this unstable planet...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.22,0:03:52.17,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Nanbu, main guns No. 1 and No. 2...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.17,0:03:52.97,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Wait !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.37,0:03:56.88,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,If we attack now, burning debris \Ncould rain down on the refugees.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.39,0:04:00.46,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Emergency ascent !\NThe Yamato will act as a decoy !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.41,0:04:06.47,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Manufactured lives...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.45,0:04:10.87,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Humanoids that are designed for war...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.92,0:04:17.12,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,....although, the civilization that created us is no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.12,0:04:23.02,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Those who named us Gatlantis\N and looked down on us have all died off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.19,0:04:25.52,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,You mean, you destroyed them ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.38,0:04:30.92,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,We, as individuals, do not\N possess the ability to reproduce.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.92,0:04:34.79,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{yueni}Therefore, we're free from the complexity of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.70,0:04:43.72,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{gatlantis}Only Gatlantis can bring real peace\N to the universe, in the way that suits us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.95,0:05:01.97,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,You are a warrior of the Yamato.\N You were summoned by Teresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.33,0:05:08.42,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,No, Teresa should never\N have called on the likes of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.23,0:05:11.18,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What are you talking about ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.27,0:05:15.95,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Pitiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.99,0:05:22.17,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,You lost your way because of the poison called emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.17,0:05:24.57,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{aino}You don't know what love is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.13,0:05:37.10,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{aida}Because of love, people die, planets perish, \Nand the universe ceases to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.82,0:05:43.17,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{sou}Exactly what you have done \Nwith your ship, Kodai Susumu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.74,0:05:44.60,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,How did you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.37,0:05:50.37,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,You have lost so many precious things...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.34,0:05:54.04,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{dakara}...that's why you are afraid of...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.36,0:05:59.47,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{aisuru}...your loved one dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.95,0:06:07.04,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,The large missiles stopped \Nat an altitude of 500 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.71,0:06:13.25,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,That Zoellugut-class ship at the center must be guiding the missiles to their optimal positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.25,0:06:14.25,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,If so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.25,0:06:15.62,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,We still have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.67,0:06:18.30,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Status on the Garmillas refugee ships ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.30,0:06:19.61,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,About to take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.61,0:06:22.12,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Good. Stand by main guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.12,0:06:24.42,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Bow wave motion shield, maximum output !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.70,0:06:25.45,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Roger !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.19,0:06:32.67,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,You must know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.06,0:06:39.23,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,...what humanity's true salvation is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.12,0:06:46.30,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{tsura}It must be hard to live with the fear of loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.52,0:06:50.72,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{sugare}You may ask for our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.42,0:06:57.95,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,The Garmillas ships have launched.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.38,0:07:00.97,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Open a path for them,\N then destroy the large missiles !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.97,0:07:02.42,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Prepare for shock wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.42,0:07:03.26,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.18,0:07:08.34,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Unit 3 !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.43,0:07:20.22,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.41,0:07:25.37,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.17,0:07:31.40,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,This occurs as I talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.73,0:07:37.05,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{yahari}After all, humans need our guidance.{ with love that can't be swayed by individual favor.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.95,0:07:46.81,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{kojin}With our true love, that can't be swayed by individual favor, that's in harmony with the nature of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.81,0:07:53.42,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Freedom from oppression, independence \Nand self governance for all humanity...{ races...}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.42,0:07:54.45,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.74,0:07:56.83,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Righteousness is on our side !{The cause's on our side.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.66,0:08:05.18,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Maintain stability !{the balance.}\N How's the wave motion shield ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.18,0:08:06.22,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.22,0:08:08.86,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Good. Attack only the \Nenemy ship's bow for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.50,0:08:15.63,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Shima, main engine maximum output !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.63,0:08:16.67,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Roger !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.20,0:08:31.22,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}This is a noble fight to end\N Garmillas' unreasonable oppression.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.22,0:08:34.47,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Do not be afraid of dying !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.89,0:08:43.58,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,This planet will break apart soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.02,0:09:01.22,def2,Hijitaka,0,0,0,,Shima, stay at the lowest altitude that's still\N safe for the ship, and hold until Kodai returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.22,0:09:02.09,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,O...okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.43,0:09:03.93,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Chief Engineer Tokugawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.93,0:09:07.30,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Engine room, stand by for escape at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.03,0:09:16.22,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Aihara, tell the Garmillas ships that we'll stay in this sector \Nuntil we recover our crewman, so they should go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.22,0:09:17.05,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.34,0:09:24.95,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Good luck to them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.28,0:09:26.95,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Stay in the safe zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.22,0:09:30.22,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,We must confirm the safety of "that person."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.07,0:09:33.50,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,I didn't expect the rebels to go this far.{do this much.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.65,0:09:36.12,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,I can...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.12,0:09:38.17,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,...I can feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.17,0:09:40.22,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,...human thoughts...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.22,0:09:43.32,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{kanjo}...and the egos that come \Nfrom the illness called "emotion."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.98,0:09:53.17,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{kono}We, Gatlantis, must put an end to this \Nrepetitious tragedy using Teresa's grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.29,0:10:02.27,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What's the connection between you guys and Teresa ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.03,0:10:17.93,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,I'll show you what your love will allow to live and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.90,0:10:33.98,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,I have placed reanimated bodies from the dead on\N each of the Garmillas ships carrying refugees to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.98,0:10:35.27,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Reanimated bodies...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.17,0:10:37.02,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.46,0:10:46.77,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,This is also a reanimated body, and it can\N turn to fire, just like the Gatlantis soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.51,0:10:53.82,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,I'll save one ship, and you will make the choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.46,0:11:02.27,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,If you don't, all three will lose their \Nengines and share in this planet's fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.67,0:11:04.32,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Say what...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.32,0:11:08.95,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Be faithful to your love and make the choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.36,0:11:12.62,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Kodai !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.86,0:11:20.09,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Are you hurt ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.45,0:11:21.37,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Saito...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.85,0:11:24.12,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Hijikata ordered me to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.12,0:11:26.01,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,What the hell was that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.80,0:11:27.52,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Kodai !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.08,0:11:33.87,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Kodai, what's wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.87,0:11:36.54,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Only one...only one ship can survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.16,0:11:38.97,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,What ? \NWhat're you talking about ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.17,0:11:44.70,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Gatlantis humanoid bombs are on\N all three of those ships, but only one ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:46.70,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Hey, Kodai !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.93,0:11:52.59,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I have to choose. That's their rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.02,0:12:03.82,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}This is Kodai. Yamato, do you copy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.30,0:12:06.47,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Kodai, so you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.47,0:12:07.47,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Mr. Hijikata...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.54,0:12:12.09,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,As soon as Kodai and Saito are back, leave this zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.59,0:12:13.63,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,To the Garmillas fleet ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.27,0:12:15.72,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}That's right, Aihara.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.72,0:12:16.79,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,On an open channel ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.29,0:12:21.97,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I want you to relay this communication to the \Nrefugees on the Garmillas ships. It's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.51,0:12:23.62,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.62,0:12:26.60,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Keyman, ask the Garmillas ships to approve.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.56,0:12:28.27,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:42.45,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Everyone, our desire was to rescue\N you on the 11th Planet and take you to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.89,0:12:47.80,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}However, the situation took an unexpected turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.61,0:12:51.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}I'm...I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.27,0:12:55.32,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Whatever happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.27,0:13:01.83,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, Lieutenant Mori \Nwill be with you all the way to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.53,0:13:07.96,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki...\NYuki, do you read me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.49,0:13:13.06,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I owe you so many apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.37,0:13:22.67,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I was afraid of losing you by \Nbringing you on this dangerous journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.67,0:13:25.22,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{iya}No, that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.22,0:13:32.13,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I was just so happy being by your \Nside that nothing else mattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.55,0:13:38.18,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{atarimae}People on Earth won't do what they're\N supposed to do, and I could become that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.31,0:13:41.69,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I was afraid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.02,0:13:46.01,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{dakara}That's why I distanced myself from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.50,0:13:52.87,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{demo}But you boarded the Yamato,\N and knowing that made me feel happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.73,0:13:57.91,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{rikutsu}I was happy, just happy, and there was no reason for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.65,0:14:04.77,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{ore}I'm such a pathetic, weak, and selfish man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.43,0:14:06.12,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.52,0:14:10.07,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}What happens next has nothing to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.65,0:14:12.92,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{ikite}I want you to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.65,0:14:15.56,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}I can't stand losing you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.43,0:14:21.22,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{donna}...regardless of how heavy the \Nburden of my sin will be, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.98,0:14:23.37,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,What happened, Kodai ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.37,0:14:24.27,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Kodai !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.27,0:14:25.90,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Please respond, Kodai !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.18,0:14:32.07,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Ms. Nagakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.54,0:14:33.54,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Mori ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.85,0:14:34.57,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,What's wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.57,0:14:36.42,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Saito, what's going on ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.42,0:14:37.67,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,What happened in the ruins ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:39.84,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&} What is Kodai talking about ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.15,0:14:45.82,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,King of Gatlantis, you can hear me, can't you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.62,0:14:48.75,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I'll choose...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.33,0:14:55.97,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Is that Miss Mori ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.97,0:14:57.08,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,What is she doing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.10,0:15:05.69,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.24,0:15:11.50,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Kodai, once you make the choice,\N you'll never forgive yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.73,0:15:15.16,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Kodai, I won't allow you to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.63,0:15:28.15,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.42,0:15:40.83,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I won't choose ! I won't !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.11,0:15:46.44,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.60,0:15:48.60,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Kodai !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.22,0:15:53.07,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,To prevent him from making a choice ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.71,0:15:58.55,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Changing the rules is unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.52,0:16:25.82,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,W...what happened ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.82,0:16:28.81,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Engine stopped ! We can't \Ncontrol the ship ! We're falling !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.81,0:16:30.01,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Increase the output !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.01,0:16:33.60,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,I can't ! At this rate, we'll be caught\N in the corruption of the planet !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.75,0:16:36.87,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}The Garmillas ships that took our refugees...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.87,0:16:38.32,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Abnormality detected at the core of the planet !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.32,0:16:40.61,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Corruption of its gravity\N field seems to have begun !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.30,0:16:45.72,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,This is the result of your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.72,0:16:53.53,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{hito}Your human arrogance{ego} to not make a\N choice will kill those you could have saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.29,0:17:01.88,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,So empty. I feel so empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.55,0:17:06.59,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.31,0:17:10.28,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.50,0:17:20.30,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.49,0:17:30.59,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,Acting Captain Kodai's signal detected, \Nbut there's no mass in that location !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.40,0:17:32.94,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,They aren't there ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.14,0:17:39.77,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Analyzer, calculate the falling trajectories of the Type-100 and Garmillas ships and calculate the intersection point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.25,0:17:41.15,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.47,0:17:44.01,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Mr. Sanada, that point could...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.38,0:17:45.22,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.22,0:17:48.22,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,If we insert a mass that's equal to the planet...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.22,0:17:53.67,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,...its energy conversion will stop the gravitational storm, which will push Kodai and the others out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.17,0:17:55.97,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,It's a risky bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.97,0:18:01.06,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,There's a chance that both the Yamato and the Garmillas ships will get caught in the gravitational epicenter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.87,0:18:02.86,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.57,0:18:11.31,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,I missed the chance to give my business card to the Gatlantis leader on the 11th planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.39,0:18:17.14,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,If he's watching, let him learn how\N determined and resilient humans are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.56,0:18:22.22,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,Analysis complete, \Nsending data to the captain's chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.50,0:18:26.12,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire the wave motion gun !\NTarget scope open !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.74,0:18:32.40,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Okita, let me borrow your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.99,0:18:42.62,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Target the core of Stravase's inner sphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.82,0:20:08.81,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.61,0:20:22.60,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.28,0:20:31.79,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.98,0:20:42.97,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,You dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.16,0:20:54.47,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.77,0:20:58.97,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,...will you marry me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.76,0:21:04.92,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to say yes ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.98,0:21:14.73,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Don't ever let me go again.{Never let me go.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.05,0:21:38.17,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}This is Yamamoto of the Cosmo Tigers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.62,0:21:41.26,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Both of them are alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.51,0:22:00.97,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Sabera...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.17,0:22:07.74,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,...must we do this again ?{repeat the same thing ?}{do we have to repeat the same ?}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.27,0:22:44.87,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(212,874)}Episode 9
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.27,0:22:44.87,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(312,1042)}Zorder's Demonic Choice
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.07,0:22:58.42,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a3\pos(1194,586)}Kodai Susumu:\NMori Yuki:\NShima Daisuke:\NSanada Shiro:\NNanbu Yasuo:\NAihara Yoshikazu:\NOhta Kenjiro:\NTokugawa Hikozaemon:\NAnalyzer: \NSaijo Miki:\NYamamoto Akira:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.07,0:22:58.42,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a5\pos(1226,146)}Ono Daisuke\NKuwashima Houko\NSuzumura Kenichi \NOtsuka Hochu\NAkabane Kenji \NKokubun Masato\NChiba Yuki\NMugihito\NCho\NMoriya Satomi\NTanaka Rie
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.42,0:23:07.27,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a3\pos(1258,496)}Saito Hajime: \NShiori Nagakura: \NHijikata Ryu:\NKatsuragi Touko:\NKeyman:\NZorder: \NMonk:\NSkipper:\NOperator:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.42,0:23:07.27,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a5\pos(1286,140)}Touchi Hiroki\NAmagai Kazusa\NIshizuka Unsho\NKaida Yuko\NKamiya Hiroshi \NTezuka Hideaki \NSawaki Ikuya\NFujinuma Kento\NYano Masaaki
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.47,0:22:53.69,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kienai de aoi tsuki yo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.47,0:22:53.69,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Blue moon, please don't fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.69,0:23:01.56,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Terashidasu kimi hitohira
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.69,0:23:01.56,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}It lights up my love just enough
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.69,0:23:18.79,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Nani hitotsu kawaranai
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.69,0:23:18.79,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Everything was routine
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.77,0:23:25.08,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Monotone iro no hibi
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.77,0:23:25.08,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Monotone days for so long
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.01,0:23:31.08,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Unmei ga tsurete kita
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.01,0:23:31.08,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Fate brought you to me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.08,0:23:37.45,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kimi no me ni koi wo shita
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.08,0:23:37.45,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I fell in love with your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.02,0:23:43.41,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Chikaku ni kanjitai yo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.02,0:23:43.41,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I want to feel you close
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.84,0:23:50.38,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Atatakai te ni furete
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.84,0:23:50.38,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Touching your warm hands
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.62,0:23:55.99,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Aa sugu ni kotoba ni dekitara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.62,0:23:55.99,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Wishing I could put this into words right away
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.71,0:24:02.06,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Konnani ai shiteru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.71,0:24:02.06,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I love you so much
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.52,0:24:08.26,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kakurenai de koigokoro yo
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.52,0:24:08.26,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Loving feelings, please don't hide
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.66,0:24:14.04,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kimi dake terashiteru yo
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.66,0:24:14.04,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}It sheds light only on you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.82,0:24:21.00,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Konya nara sou ieru
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.82,0:24:21.00,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I can say that because tonight is different
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.07,0:24:44.52,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(970,662)}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.30,0:24:47.20,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Are they going to devour the system ?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.49,0:24:50.33,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Operation Chief Mori, we have a problem. \NActing Captain Kodai is...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.33,0:24:52.16,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,I want to be on a ship where I can fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.16,0:24:53.11,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Take back what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.11,0:24:54.38,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,I won't say anything.{'ll keep my mouth shut.}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.38,0:24:57.29,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,I've arranged the gift you desire most.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.05,0:24:58.05,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\fscx135\fscy103\pos(964,462)}Episode 10
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.05,0:24:58.05,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(968,684)}Deceptive Space Fireflies Bring Danger

